domain ADR0031Acceptance:
  description "Record exact owner acceptance of ADR0031 revision1 without widening implementation authority."
problem P1:
  "Determine the lifecycle state and authority boundary after the owner replied ACCEPT to the reviewed ADR0031 revision1."
evidence E_SNAPSHOT:
  |
    The pre-acceptance authoritative ADR0031 revision1 SHA-256 was
    cf623039913261e5735166f91ad07aa82d6640393614f82cbadc47a1e2367e16.
    Its complete Japanese review scope and Markdown projection were presented.
evidence E_REVIEW:
  |
    The independent internal and related-ADR review returned PASS with no P0,
    P1, P2 or P3 findings. It retained exact DTOs, numeric policy, detector
    rules, public mappings, implementation conformance and provider evidence as
    downstream unknowns.
evidence OWNER_ACCEPTANCE:
  |
    On 2026-09-11 the product owner replied ACCEPT to the explicit ACCEPT or
    REVISE choice for exact ADR0031 revision1 after the review presentation.
premise BOUNDARY:
  |
    The ADR and its review distinguish architecture acceptance from
    implementation, provider use, evaluation, deployment, migration,
    activation, rollback, release and prior-ADR lifecycle changes.
decision ACCEPTANCE based_on P1, E_SNAPSHOT, E_REVIEW, OWNER_ACCEPTANCE, BOUNDARY:
  |
    Record ADR0031 revision1 as Accepted. Authorize preparation and review of
    the D11 implementation design only. Retain separate authority gates for
    implementation and every other excluded effect.
